# Renderer validation scene (Triangulated)
# Coordinate convention:
#   +X = right
#   +Y = up
#   +Z = forward / camera-facing
#
# Objects:
#   Floor       - large tiled-style plane made from 4 quads
#   Cube_Close  - close cube, tests depth and perspective
#   Cube_Far    - distant cube, tests perspective
#   Pyramid     - asymmetric pyramid, tests transforms/culling
#   RGB_Triangle- single triangle for barycentric color interpolation
#
# The scene intentionally uses no textures or materials.
# Vertex colors can be assigned by object/face in your engine.

o Floor
v -10 0 0
v -5 0 0
v 0 0 0
v 5 0 0
v 10 0 0
v -10 0 5
